{"steam_appid":2697930,"steam_name":"Commander Quest","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2697930/1359515362/b72b80a8269efd5d05b559c696b908f5a48bcfda/1750818878/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749027904","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257150893/61967bbcb083c878ff66baaa828df5654d680682/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749027904","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/398aeaafe0341667d9d1df7956a6380e335f72cf/ss_398aeaafe0341667d9d1df7956a6380e335f72cf.1920x1080.jpg?t=1754381787","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/9c33aef9d34191e67aec9146fde72266547429bf/ss_9c33aef9d34191e67aec9146fde72266547429bf.1920x1080.jpg?t=1754381787","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/1a3bbd1f1ccc11d37ea92fffee7dafb12387497f/ss_1a3bbd1f1ccc11d37ea92fffee7dafb12387497f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1754381787","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/d42501cd3137e64171646e9d20ec2d2fd2678a6f/ss_d42501cd3137e64171646e9d20ec2d2fd2678a6f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1754381787","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/193c4736975d07683b8e751ae9bd700dfd25bd50/ss_193c4736975d07683b8e751ae9bd700dfd25bd50.1920x1080.jpg?t=1754381787"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/extras/f8ab49684953e9418d96cd91375603fd.avif?t=1754381787\" width=642 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/extras/49947fccccf7ce00fbab25ac034db423.poster.avif?t=1754381787\" width=640 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/extras/49947fccccf7ce00fbab25ac034db423.webm?t=1754381787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/extras/49947fccccf7ce00fbab25ac034db423.mp4?t=1754381787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Summon. Command. Triumph.&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fusion of deck-building roguelike and auto-battle simulator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legendary commanders from history return to the battlefield—this time in a fantasy world teeming with magic, curses, dwarves, and dragons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/extras/f3dbcf54d8176d2427a1a4da752059e5.avif?t=1754381787\" width=642 height=113 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/extras/b3dc0ed7cc61e82fde7aba4e35697201.poster.avif?t=1754381787\" width=640 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/extras/b3dc0ed7cc61e82fde7aba4e35697201.webm?t=1754381787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/extras/b3dc0ed7cc61e82fde7aba4e35697201.mp4?t=1754381787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;</strong>Strategic Play with Deck Building<strong>&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your battle rewards wisely, and craft your own deck by combining a wide array of cards and relics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From cavalry units that break through enemy lines, to unyielding dwarves of steel, feral beasts, and ghostly legions—various synergies await your command.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the perfect synergy, cover your deck’s weaknesses, and strike at the enemy’s vulnerabilities as they grow stronger with every stage. Your journey leads to a final, decisive confrontation!&lt;br&gt;<br>　</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　<br>　</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/extras/2231a3a745491bb36f787300228577e9.avif?t=1754381787\" width=642 height=113 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/extras/da02b2be7370f4307c02f884ed812758.poster.avif?t=1754381787\" width=640 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/extras/da02b2be7370f4307c02f884ed812758.webm?t=1754381787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/extras/da02b2be7370f4307c02f884ed812758.mp4?t=1754381787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;A Variety of In-Game Events&quot;&lt;br&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat isn't the only thing waiting for you on this journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might encounter quirky events, like a druidic group trying to protect a horde of rats, or a goblin salesman enthusiastically pitching long-term savings plans. You’ll also have the chance to take part in eerie experiments to customize your own cards—or simply enjoy the thrill of discovering powerful relics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice is yours to make. Will your decisions lead you to victory?&lt;br&gt;<br>　</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/extras/7a6dc084d5d90a25e8bc816f797e44e1.webp?t=1754381787\" width=620 height=40 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/extras/112401f573711f73b3141767a48c3473.poster.avif?t=1754381787\" width=620 height=345 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697930/extras/112401f573711f73b3141767a48c3473.webm?t=1754381787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5-4670K @ 3.4Ghz or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 970 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5000 MB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 3600 @ 3.60 Ghz or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5000 MB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Indie","Simulation","Strategy"],"developers":["Flyway Games, Inc."],"publishers":["Flyway Games, Inc.","KRAFTON, Inc."],"release_date":"4 Apr, 2025"}